    "body": "## Purpose\n\nMixed prefill/decode batches can select an MTP decode graph with more rows than the target batch. The extra block-table rows can retain another request's block IDs. On GLM-5.3-Flash, a padded KPool tail write then corrupts that request's KDA state.\n\nRefresh the shared block tables after choosing the draft graph size. During dummy runs, clear only the extra rows, preserving valid profiling slots.\n\nThis fixes the MRV2 draft block-table rows, separate from #45005 (legacy slot-mapping padding) and #60767 (sliding-window columns). No LMCache dependency or model-math change.\n\n## Test Plan\n\nOn H20, against main `36f397281295` (including #60692):\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest \\\n  tests/v1/worker/test_gpu_target_dependent_ar_speculator.py \\\n  -q --tb=short -p no:cacheprovider\n```\n\nThe regression covers padded/unpadded batches, PCP on/off, fused/unfused decode, and real/null/valid dummy tables. It checks physical KPool write slots and preserves active rows.\n\n## Test Result\n\n- All applicable pre-commit hooks passed, including type checking and Buildkite test tethering.\n- New regression: **12/24 fail before the fix; 24/24 pass after it**. Full speculator suite: **51 passed**.\n- Cache/offload compatibility suites: **652 passed** (commands below).\n- Earlier serving validation on `d4e92ccc37e`, H20×8, GLM-5.3-Flash, TP8/MTP3: **640/640 controlled streamed requests correct**, with no output-cap truncation, across native CPU offload and LMCache (two fresh runs each, reversed order). The replay covers cold, GPU-hot, CPU-restored and branched prefixes; output cap 1024 with natural stopping. This is correctness validation, not a throughput claim.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Compatibility test command</summary>\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest \\\n  tests/models/glm5next/test_kda_state_dtype.py \\\n  tests/model_executor/test_attention_warmup.py \\\n  tests/v1/core/prefix_cache/test_partial_prefix_cache_hits.py \\\n  tests/v1/kv_connector/unit/offloading_connector/test_scheduler.py \\\n  tests/v1/kv_connector/unit/test_remote_prefill_lifecycle.py \\\n  tests/v1/kv_offload/test_factory.py \\\n  -x -q --tb=short\n```\n\n</details>\n\nAI assistance was used for implementation and tests. I reviewed the changes and personally ran the relevant tests.\n\n---\n<details>\n<summary> Essential Elements of an Effective PR Description Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] The purpose of the PR and root cause are described.\n- [x] The test plan includes the regression command.\n- [x] Test results include before/after and model validation.\n- [x] Documentation: no public API or configuration change.\n\n</details>\n",
